or System Performance' activity occurs, then 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity must occur after that 'Monitor System Performance' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor System Performance' occurs, with no other occurrence of 'Monitor System Performance' allowed between a 'Monitor System Performance' and its corresponding 'Resolve Integration Issues'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves monitoring the performance of the system after deployment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Integration Issues\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity involves identifying and resolving any issues that arise during integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Plan Integration' activity occurs in a process instance, then 'Document Integration Process' activity must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Plan Integration' event. If 'Plan Integration' does not occur, there is no requirement for 'Document Integration Process' to occur. Multiple occurrences of 'Plan Integration' are satisfied by at least one occurrence of 'Document Integration Process', and multiple 'Document Integration Process' instances are allowed.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Plan Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Plan Integration' activity represents the initial planning phase for the integration project.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Document Integration Process\",\"description\":\"The 'Document Integration Process' activity involves documenting the steps and procedures of the integration process.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Train Users' a