of 'Approve Integration Design' must occur before any instance of 'Validate Integration Results'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity involves approving the design of the integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Validate Integration Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Validate Integration Results' activity involves validating the results of the integration to ensure they meet requirements.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Documentation' activity must not be followed by a 'Gather User Feedback' activity at any point later in the same process instance. This means that once a 'Update System Documentation' event occurs, 'Gather User Feedback' cannot occur afterward. However, 'Gather User Feedback' events occurring before the 'Update System Documentation' are permitted. The constraint ensures that after the occurrence of 'Update System Documentation', the process does not allow any further occurrences of 'Gather User Feedback'.\",\"template\":\"Not Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Update System Documentation\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Documentation' activity involves updating the system documentation to reflect changes from the integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Gather User Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather User Feedback' activity involves collecting feedback from users about the integrated system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"At least one of the activities 'Plan Integration' or 'Design System Architecture' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if 'Plan Integration' event occurs, 'Design System Architecture' event occurs, or both occur. There is no